cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the manuscript listed under
  preferred-citation rather than the software itself.
title: >-
  structural-addresses: reference implementation and reproducibility companion
  for "Structural Addresses: Continuous Proximity, Discrete Membership, and
  Compatible Markers in Inheritance Systems"
abstract: >-
  Lightweight reproducibility companion reproducing the computational claims of
  the methodological note: the detuned Ramanujan 1/pi family, the beta/gamma
  family J(s) = Gamma(s+1)^2/Gamma(2s+2), a four-state deterministic
  inheritance control demonstrating that closure and separation are independent
  marker properties, and both manuscript figures.
